
    <h5 class="fw-bold text-primary">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill me-2"></i> Password & Security Policy
    </h5>
    <ul class="mb-3">
        <li><strong>Password Length:</strong> Minimum <strong>12</strong>, maximum <strong>128</strong> characters</li>
        <li>
            <strong>Must include all of the following:</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>✅ At least one uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>
                <li>✅ At least one lowercase letter (a–z)</li>
                <li>✅ At least one digit (0–9)</li>
                <li>✅ <strong>At least 4 special characters</strong> (e.g. <code>@@</code>, <code>!</code>, <code>#</code>, <code>%</code>) — <strong>not repeated consecutively</strong></li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>❌ Must not include your <strong>username</strong> or personal identifiers</li>
        <li>❌ Must not include <strong>even year patterns</strong> (e.g. <code>1990</code>, <code>2024</code>)</li>
        <li>🚫 Avoid forbidden words: <code>password</code>, <code>welcome</code>, <code>admin</code>, etc.</li>
        <li>🔁 Cannot reuse any of your <strong>last 5 passwords</strong></li>
        <li>🚫 Must not contain sequential patterns: <code>1234</code>, <code>abcd</code>, <code>qwerty</code></li>
        <li>🚫 Repeated characters like <code>aaa</code>, <code>1111</code> are not allowed</li>
        <li>🕒 Passwords should be updated regularly — <strong>every 60–90 days</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-danger">🚫 Default Password Notice</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>🔐 <strong>Using any default or system-suggested password without modification is not allowed.</strong></li>
        <li>❌ If you copy and paste an initial password directly, the system will reject it for security reasons.</li>
        <li>✅ A personalized, stronger password will be proposed if a default is detected.</li>
        <li>🛡️ Always change any suggested or temporary password immediately to a custom one only you know.</li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-primary">🔐 Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)</h6>
    <p>
        You must activate at least one MFA method:
        <strong>SMS</strong>, <strong>Email</strong>, or <strong>Authenticator App</strong> (TOTP).
        Grace period for setup: <strong>3 days</strong> from account creation.
    </p>

    <h6 class="text-primary">🧩 Compliance & Account Hygiene</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>⏳ Inactivity may result in automatic account suspension</li>
        <li>📅 Accounts not activated within <strong>3 days</strong> may be deleted</li>
        <li>🔒 Always enable MFA and keep recovery methods updated</li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-warning">🛡️ Security Awareness</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>🔑 Never share your password — even with IT support</li>
        <li>🧠 Use unique passwords for different systems</li>
        <li>📵 Avoid saving passwords in browsers or sticky notes</li>
        <li>🚫 Don’t use common tricks like <code>P@ssw0rd</code></li>
        <li>⚠️ Always log out when using public/shared computers</li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-danger">🔁 How to Change Your Password</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>Go to <strong>Settings &gt; Security &gt; Change Password</strong></li>
        <li>Enter your current and new password</li>
        <li>Ensure new password meets <strong>all listed requirements</strong></li>
        <li>If locked out, contact your <strong>branch administrator</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-success">💡 Example Passwords</h6>
    <ul>
        <li><code>@@Rise4!Truth#Now$</code> ✅ Strong, compliant</li>
        <li><code>Sun@Flower!1801#Pie</code> ✅ Meets all rules</li>
        <li><code>Password2024!</code> ❌ Contains forbidden word + even year</li>
        <li><code>User@123!</code> ❌ Contains username & sequential pattern</li>
        <li><code>@@Welcome123@@</code> ❌ Default style + forbidden word</li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-primary">✨ System Assistance Available</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>🤖 The system can help you <strong>generate a secure, compliant password</strong> automatically.</li>
        <li>🎯 Click the <strong>"Generate"</strong> button below the form to instantly get a strong password.</li>
        <li>🧠 Generated passwords meet <strong>all policy rules</strong> — including length, complexity, and exclusions.</li>
        <li>💾 Once generated, you can <strong>copy</strong> or <strong>download</strong> the password for safe keeping.</li>
    </ul>

    <h6 class="text-info">🔐 How to Store or Save Your Password Safely</h6>
    <ul>
        <li>🧩 Use a trusted <strong>password manager</strong> (e.g. Bitwarden, 1Password, Dashlane, KeePass) to store your passwords securely.</li>
        <li>📥 <strong>Do not save passwords in browsers</strong> if the device is shared or not protected by a master password or biometric lock.</li>
        <li>📝 Avoid writing passwords down on paper or saving them in unencrypted files like Notepad or Excel.</li>
        <li>🔒 If you must store your password manually, use an encrypted storage method and keep it offline.</li>
        <li>📌 Consider using a <strong>memory-based passphrase</strong> strategy: combine random but memorable words and symbols (e.g. <code>Blue!Train#Lemon@89</code>).</li>
        <li>🚫 Never store your password in emails, chats, or unprotected notes.</li>
        <li>📤 If a password was generated for you, <strong>save it securely before closing this window</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

